Scope and provenance
--------------------
forge9 is an independent, interoperability-oriented implementation of the RPF9
container file format. It is code and documentation describing a file format.

- This repository contains no game code, assets, archives, executables, cipher
  tables, or keys, and none may be contributed. It distributes no content
  belonging to any game or its publisher.
- Commands that open an archive require cipher material (tables.bin, keys.bin)
  that the user extracts from their own legally obtained copy of the software.
  forge9 does not ship, generate, or help obtain that material.
- All tests use fixtures generated in-repo. No sample derives from any game.
- forge9 is not affiliated with, authorized by, or endorsed by any game
  publisher. Trademarks and format field names are used descriptively only.

The project's purpose is understanding and interoperating with a file format,
not reproducing, distributing, or enabling unauthorized access to any protected
work. Use forge9 only with files you are lawfully permitted to use.
